{{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}

Brand: {{ $('Set Niche Config').item.json.brand_name }}
Niche: {{ $('Set Niche Config').item.json.niche }}
Audience: {{ $('Set Niche Config').item.json.target_audience }}
Style: {{ $('Set Niche Config').item.json.content_style }}

For each script:
- Hook (0-3 sec): pattern interrupt opening
- Body (4-30 sec): core value, fast-paced
- CTA (last 5 sec): follow or comment ask
- On-screen text suggestions
- Trending sound recommendation

Return JSON:
{
  "scripts": [
    {
      "trend_used": "",
      "hook": "",
      "body": "",
      "cta": "",
      "on_screen_text": [],
      "sound_suggestion": "",
      "hashtags": [],
      "estimated_viral_potential": "low/medium/high"
    }
  ],
  "best_posting_times": []
}

parameters.jsCode:
const raw = $input.item.json.text.replace(/```json|```/g,'').trim();
const data = JSON.parse(raw);
return [{ json: data }];

